<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 12, 2003 :: The secret is out!</div><P align=center><IMG alt="Ain't no big thing!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/nibbler/quote1.gif" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Nibbler</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 11, 2003 :: Grats Mys on your 10th Ring!</div><P>And thanks for letting us have a nice war again. Of course yours was full of mayhem. /smirks</P>
<P>Mys earned her <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/ring_dain_frostweaver.jpg">Ring of Dain Frostreaver IV</A>, Garrich got a nice <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/crown_of_narandi.jpg">Crown of Narandi</A>, Balut is sporting a new <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/Choker_of_the_Wretched.jpg">Choker of the Wretched</A>, Fezz got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/faceguard_bentos_hero.jpg">Faceguard of Bentos the Hero</A>, Tsochi got the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=6789">Eye of Narandi</A>, and Mahrsan won the greed roll on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/narandis_lance.jpg">Narandi's Lance</A> while Morlith won the greed roll on the <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/earringfrozenskull.jpg">Earring of the Frozen Skull</A>. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 10, 2003 :: Kland and more levels </div><P>Thanks Kithik for spotting Kland and thanks everyone for running out and killing another dragon! Grats Grajin on your talisman!</P>
<P>Grats Lushissx on Muse!<BR>Grats Ladibugg and Grace on 58!<BR>Grats Tearem on 57!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 16, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 9, 2003 :: Some levels and a dead guppy</div><P align=center><FONT color=#9900ff size=5>Happy Birthday Davius!!</FONT></P>
<P>Grats Bearspirit on 65 and Prophet!<BR>Grats Bashiuss and Eolh on 61!<BR>Grats Mytee on 55 and Beguiler!<BR>Grats Khyrra on 45!</P>
<P>Late at night found Reide and Greylok bored. So after finding Ulump up for Dyanna, we decided it'd be fun to kill Fay with us two and Vaeabot. Too easy. :(</P>
<P><IMG alt=Guppy! hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/fay.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 10, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 8, 2003 :: Lord Yelinak Dead!</div><P>Well, our Saturday target was already dead, so we went looking for something else to do and found Yelinak up in his lair. We went up and up and up to bring him down! </P>
<P>Grats Reide on getting some head (to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/gauntletsodslaying.jpg">Gauntlets of Dragon Slaying</A>), Kantar on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/yelinaks_talisman.JPG">Yelinak's Talisman</A> (cause clerics need 41% haste!), Vorne on a neat toy - <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/soul_defiler.jpg">Soul Defiler</A>, Lairiel saved an <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/outriders_taming_whip.jpg">Outrider's Taming Whip</A> from rotting (cause you gotta have whips) and Aridius and Jenrenee each won the greed roll on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/dragonsbloodearring.jpg">Dragon's Blood Earring</A>. </P>
<P><IMG alt="Thanks for the boots!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yel.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yeldead.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P align=center><FONT color=#9966cc size=5>Happy Birthday Lentor!</FONT> /ducks</P>
<P>Grats Eolh on 60 and High Priestess!<BR>Grats Feskan on 64!<BR>Grats Lumalie on 59!<BR>Grats Yimish on 58!<BR>Grats Gargaden on 54!<BR>Grats Arwiin on 49!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 7, 2003 :: Sleeper's Tomb Wandering</div><P>Found a couple things up for killing while exploring through the zone tonight. Milas An'Rev, Furious Phantasm and Sinister Gargoyle were what we stumbled across for killing. </P>
<P>Grats Saragoth on your <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Ancient_Prismatic_Warsword.jpg">Ancient Prismatic Warsword</A>, Colwn on your super ugly <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics19/Premier_Axe_of_Secundae.jpg">Premier Axe of Secundae</A>, Meeka and Balut each saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/db/item.html?item=16078">Furious Shroud of Unlife</A> from rotting and various folks on quest loots. </P>
<P><IMG alt="" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/milas.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Jenrenee on 65 and Lady Protector!<BR>Grats Lentor on 65 and Feral Lord!<BR>Grats Yimish on 57!<BR>Grats Moordred on 55 and Defiler!<BR>Grats Morlith on 51 and Reaver!</P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 8, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 6, 2003 :: Eh.. Velk</div><P>Thought we'd do a Ring War for Mys, but turns out the trigger wasn't up. So being the lazy people we are, we opted to just head one zone over and kill Velk instead. </P>
<P>Zavitar saved a <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/crystal_crown_confusion.jpg">Crystal Crown of Confusion</A> from rotting, then had a nice rant, Balut saved this <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/vermillonorboftorrefaction.jpg">Vermilion Orb of Torrefaction</A> from the rot gods, Yimish won <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/velketor_spellbook.jpg">Velketor's Spellbook</A>&nbsp;on GREED and Mahrsan won the oh-so-uber <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics15/Bracelet_Of_Frostbite.jpg">Bracelet of Frostbite</A> on GREED. </P>
<P><IMG alt="Zav loves the effect! So practical!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zavrant.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR>Yes, they did change the time to 15 seconds. I think the one on Alla's says 8, that's incorrect. Prob waaayyy too powerful at 8. /snickers</P>
<P><IMG alt="Not Feet!" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/velk.jpg" align=baseline border=0><BR>So Velk did resist Vorne's unresistable&nbsp;Harm Touch&nbsp;and gate. No biggie though, he just made us jog into his room and kill him at his throne. Vorne's not bitter or anything. </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Nov 5, 2003 :: King Tormax dead!</div><P>Patch day came and along with it Kithik spotted King Tormax on his throne. We made our way there and Mahrsan pulled with his tag team of Colwn and Vorne as backup. Our first chance getting to KT first found him dead at our feet. Nice work all! </P>
<P>Grats Antroe on Shard of Hsagra's Talisman, Davius on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/king_tormaxs_head.jpg">King Tormax's Head</A>&nbsp;(to make <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/whitedragonscaleboots.jpg">White Dragonscale Boots</A>), Mahrsan on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics16/WristGuardofThunder.JPG">Wrist Guard of Thunder</A>, Tellie on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/ring_of_lightning.jpg">Ring of Lightning</A> and Garacaius and Vorne on <A href="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/rpics/bootsofthestorm.jpg">Boots of the Storm</A>. </P>
<P><A href="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormax.jpg"><IMG alt="The King is Dead" hspace=0 src="http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormax.jpg" align=baseline border=0></A></P>
<P><IMG alt="Go cASS!" hspace=0 src="http://www.shiningindarkness.com/images/Sigs/tormaxkillshot.jpg" align=baseline border=0></P>
<P>Grats Aironexus on 65 and Archon!<BR>Grats Tristastar on 50! </P><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Meeka on Nov 5, 2003</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages: <a href='news.asp?page=9'>&laquo;</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=1'>1</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=8'>8</a> <a href='news.asp?page=9'>9</a> 10 <a href='news.asp?page=11'>11</a> <a href='news.asp?page=12'>12</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=11'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
				<div class="headlines">
<a href=news.asp?newsid=620><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/manaetic_behemoth.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Mar 26</b></a> - Manetic Behemoth and Cap!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=612><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/althumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 29</b></a> - Flawless Victory!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=611><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/adthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 28</b></a> - Aerin'Dar, dragon o' pally loot!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=605><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/grummthumb.gif border=0 width=125><br><b>Feb 1</b></a> - I'm bigger than you.. I'm higher on the food chain!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=602><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/littleterry.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Jan 24</b></a> - Terris Thule Naptime!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=575><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/dainthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 22</b></a> - Dain Frostreaver's Feet!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=563><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/yelinak.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 8</b></a> - Lord Yelinak!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=562><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/stthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 7</b></a> - Visit to Sleeper's Tomb<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=560><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/tormaxthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Nov 5</b></a> - The King is Dead!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=547><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/vpthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 26</b></a> - Veeshan's Peak cleared!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=543><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/narandithumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 21</b></a> - Mahrsan gets his 10th Ring, and we get to have a war!<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=542><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/lendthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 18</b></a> - Keep this, beotch! And Sont too..<p><a href=news.asp?newsid=524><img src=http://nibbler.servepics.com/capulus/uploads/meeka/zlandthumb.jpg border=0 width=125><br><b>Oct 3</b></a> - Zland and Kland go down... naughty..<p>
